  "bodyHash": "907d1db1e9655d13",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃更新的模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于本模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Hoe Tweaks 为锄头工具提供了多种实用便利（QoL）调整。完全支持自定义配置。可加快收获作物方块（南瓜/西瓜）的速度，支持翻耕与取消翻耕土壤，并根据锄头材质（如木/钻石）扩大耕作范围。默认情况下，需按住蹲下键才能使用扩大范围。<br><br>使用扩大范围耕作时，每多翻耕一个方块，锄头将受到一次耐久损耗。系统已计算“耐久”附魔的影响。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收录于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收录于 Serilum 的 QoL 组合包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"运行环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>onlyUntillWithOtherHandEmpty</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，仅在副手为空时才能使用取消翻耕功能。允许手持锄头的同时用另一只手放置种子。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>cropBlockBreakSpeedModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：8.0，最小值：0.0，最大值：20.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">作物方块（南瓜/西瓜）的破坏速度相比原版快多少倍。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustCrouchToHaveBiggerHoeRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家在右键点击中心方块时，是否只有在蹲下状态下才能使用扩大的锄头范围。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>woodenTierHoeRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：0，最小值：0，最大值：32</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">木锄的耕作范围（蹲下时的默认值）。0 = 1x1</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>stoneTierHoeRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：1，最小值：0，最大值：32</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">石锄的耕作范围（蹲下时的默认值）。1 = 3x3</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>goldTierHoeRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：2，最小值：0，最大值：32</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">金锄的耕作范围（蹲下时的默认值）。2 = 5x5</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ironTierHoeRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：2，最小值：0，最大值：32</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">铁锄的耕作范围（蹲下时的默认值）。2 = 5x5</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>diamondTierHoeRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：3，最小值：0，最大值：32</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">钻石锄的耕作范围（蹲下时的默认值）。3 = 7x7</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>netheriteTierHoeRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：4，最小值：0，最大值：32</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">下界合金锄的耕作范围（蹲下时的默认值）。4 = 9x9</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>更快地收获南瓜和西瓜：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hoe-tweaks/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"554\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>使用钻石锄进行翻耕与取消翻耕，默认面积为 7x7：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hoe-tweaks/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"550\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>另一个使用石锄的例子，面积为 3x3。右键点击已翻耕的方块即可取消翻耕：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hoe-tweaks/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用本模组，只要下载源仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在如此多的独立模组页面上逐一跟进评论，因此已禁用评论功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他反馈，请访问我们的&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 仓库</a>。感谢支持！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
